{
  "sheet": "encounters",
  "about": "Random encounters, FFX style, with each world's own enemies. When a field room spawns its enemies, the mod takes them out of the world (frozen, far below the floor) into that room's encounter pool, so no enemy roams. Walking in a room with a pool fills a hidden danger meter (systems.encounterMeter*); when it fills, the screen shatters and a few of the pool's enemies line up in front of the party. A room whose own spawns hold no enemies (save points, towns) has an empty pool and never has encounters. Story and boss fights (KH2 battle type 2) are never pooled: they are taken over as turn-based battles. The arenas below are only used by Melty's test mode, to reach a room with enemies in the same world as the test save (Twilight Town: the Sandlot's Dusks; Olympus Coliseum: the Underworld room he17's Soldiers and Air Soldiers, an ambush group the player is placed in).",
